# Files and directories to exclude from Windows Dart package.
# Patterns are relative to package root: python-windows-for-dart-<version>/

# Stdlib content not needed for embedded runtime package.
Lib/test
Lib/idlelib
Lib/tkinter
Lib/turtledemo
Lib/ensurepip
Lib/pydoc_data
Lib/lib2to3
Lib/site-packages/pip*
Lib/site-packages/setuptools*
Lib/site-packages/wheel*
# profiling (new in 3.15): cProfile imports profiling.tracing at module load, so the
# package itself must stay. The sampling profiler's web-report assets (vendored d3 JS,
# logos, CSS/HTML templates, ~690KB that would survive .py deletion) are pure dead
# weight embedded; pruning them only degrades report generation, not `import profiling`.
Lib/profiling/sampling/_vendor
Lib/profiling/sampling/_assets
Lib/profiling/sampling/_flamegraph_assets
Lib/profiling/sampling/_heatmap_assets
Lib/profiling/sampling/_shared_assets
# Interactive-REPL / dev-only modules + easter eggs / frozen demos.
# _pyrepl is intentionally NOT pruned: CPython 3.14's pydoc and pdb import it at
# module load (3.15 made those imports guarded, but we keep it so pydoc / pdb /
# pytest keep full functionality).
Lib/rlcompleter.py
Lib/tabnanny.py
Lib/antigravity.py
Lib/this.py
Lib/__hello__.py
Lib/__phello__

# Optional/test/GUI extension modules and DLLs.
DLLs/_test*.pyd
DLLs/_ctypes_test*.pyd
DLLs/_tkinter*.pyd
DLLs/xxlimited*.pyd
DLLs/xxsubtype*.pyd
DLLs/tcl86t.dll
DLLs/tk86t.dll
# Tcl/Tk 9 names (3.15+ builds Tcl 9): tcl90.dll, tcl9tk90.dll + its libtommath.
DLLs/tcl90*.dll
DLLs/tcl9tk90*.dll
DLLs/libtommath.dll
DLLs/zlib1.dll
DLLs/pyshellext.dll
DLLs/pyshellext_d.dll
